// BGXAI 039 (ORIGINAL CODE): lower-priority team protection atop installed BGX38 + EPS.
// Guard selected via existing BGX38_GUARD=1 (F hotkey); no new keys / no changes to EPS.
// EXTEND_BOTTOM after existing BGX38: prioritize protagonist if 038 wants to guard.
// Never guard self (InPartySlot); refuse to interrupt existing actions (ActionListEmpty).
// First prioritize wounded (below 65%) ward, then any directly threatened ally.
// Priority amongst equal threats is static: Player3,4,5,6,2. This is NOT full threat AI.
// ProtectObject may be persistent: no automatic cancellation is claimed.
// Urgent ward Player3; guardian cannot protect itself.
IF
  InParty(Myself)
  !InPartySlot(Myself,0)
  Global("BGX38_GUARD","LOCALS",1)
  ActionListEmpty()
  InParty(Player3)
  !InPartySlot(Myself,2)
  See(Player3)
  Range(Player3,10)
  See(NearestEnemyOf(Player3))
  Range(NearestEnemyOf(Player3),7)
  HPPercentLT(Player3,65)
  !GlobalTimerNotExpired("BGX39_TEAM_CD","LOCALS")
THEN
  RESPONSE #100
    SetGlobalTimer("BGX39_TEAM_CD","LOCALS",8)
    ProtectObject(Player3,6)
END

